## Deck

::bg{location="deck" time="dawn"}
::music{action="start" mood="upbeat" volume="normal"}
@narrator: The sea around the Gull's Mercy has gone flat and bright as a coin.
@sefa{emotion="surprised"}: The current's stopped. Brann, the current has stopped.
@brann: Then the thing on the throne is dead. Or it's waiting.
@ilo: It's dead. I watched it come apart.
@brann{emotion="grim"}: Things down there come apart and put themselves back together, boy. Tell me all of it. Later.
